# The flooded land is an Island "for as long as it has a flood counter on it" (CR 611.2b), not for as long as Eluge is
# around: Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the 2/2 Eluge and Bot1's Forest is still an Island (the ruling). Then Vampire
# Hexmage removes all counters from the Forest, and the moment its flood counter is gone it is a Forest alone again,
# with no {U} ability (CR 305.6).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Eluge, the Shoreless Sea
Vampire Hexmage
Island
Island
Forest
Swamp
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x18

