Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Eluge, the Shoreless Sea.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
