Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Eluge, the Shoreless Sea)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Eluge, the Shoreless Sea; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Island
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
